{"id":"47","title":"47","image":"images/47.jpg","width":1268,"height":2000,"blocks":[{"text":"48","lines":1,"cx":828,"cy":93.5,"w":34,"h":19,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"48"}},{"text":"Dertkez","lines":1,"cx":820,"cy":782.5,"w":239.1,"h":36,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"The dead"}},{"text":"Kepek insanlarqa en doğru dostdur. Insan pek isine ve coq fajdalar ketire. Evni qaravulla Аvçыlaга jaгdüm ete, ez sahiвini pek seve olarga jaltaqlana. Balalar da kepekni pek sevel Naṣúl kepek adlarь вilesiniz? Kepekge nasыl hajvanlar uşaj?","lines":6,"cx":750.8,"cy":1034,"w":1028.1,"h":432,"angle":0,"bg":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"The moth is the truest friend of humans. Man is very angry and brings many harms. The guard of the house gives it to Avchyla, who loves his children and waves to them. Children also love lice. What kind of lice do you name? What kind of animals eat frogs?"}},{"text":"Kopek ajta:","lines":1,"cx":815.8,"cy":1394.5,"w":536.4,"h":112.1,"angle":2.2,"bg":"rgb(250, 250, 250)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"Kopek said:"}},{"text":"Jazqa oogsam,","lines":1,"cx":583,"cy":1549,"w":613.9,"h":130.4,"angle":4.5,"bg":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"The sound of the music,"}},{"text":"kemikden","lines":1,"cx":1108,"cy":1513.3,"w":306,"h":69.5,"angle":-6.6,"bg":"rgb(165, 165, 165)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"chemistry"}},{"text":"saraj salirman!","lines":1,"cx":816.5,"cy":1684.8,"w":658.9,"h":79.2,"angle":-4.4,"bg":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"Saraj Salirman!"}},{"text":"Kopeksiz koj olmaz","lines":1,"cx":779,"cy":1880,"w":878.7,"h":145.3,"angle":-3.6,"bg":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","fg":"#111111","translations":{"en":"Kopeksiz koy olmaz"}}]}